              "text": "Domino's operates on a franchise model, meaning many voucher codes are location-specific. However, there are several highly valuable national deals, seasonal promotions, and standard coupon codes active.\n\n---\n\n### **\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 United States (June 2026)**\n\n*   **\ud83d\udea8 LAST DAY! 50% Off All Pizzas:** Today (**Sunday, June 7, 2026**) is the final day of Domino's National Dairy Month celebration. You can get **50% off all menu-priced pizzas**. This applies to online, app, phone, and in-store orders\u2014just click/ask for the \"50% off\" coupon before checking out.\n*   **Mix & Match Deal ($6.99 each):** Choose any two or more medium 2-topping pizzas, breads, salads, chicken, sandwiches, pasta, or desserts for **$6.99 each**. \n    *   *Common Code:* **9193** (or simply select it on the \"Deals\" tab of the app/website).\n*   **Carryout Deal ($7.99):** Get a 1-topping pizza (any crust style except XL or specialty), Dips & Twists combo, or 8-piece wings for **$7.99** (Carryout only, no code needed).\n*   **20% Off Code:** Text **PIZZA** to **366466** to receive a unique 20% off coupon code sent directly to your phone.\n*   **Free Slice Sauce:** Through June 14, 2026, you can get a free Slice Sauce when you buy any Handmade Pan or Parmesan Stuffed Crust pizza online or in-app.\n\n---\n\n### **\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 United Kingdom (June 2026)**\n\n*   **50% Off Code:** **DINEON50** or **FOODHERO** \u2014 Get **50% off** your total order when you spend \u00a325 or more. *(Note: Exclusions apply, and some local stores may opt out of national discount codes).*\n*   **35% Off Code:** **KEYDDTPO** \u2014 Save **35% off** orders over \u00a340.\n*   **Student Discount (50% Off):** If you are a student, log in through **UNiDAYS** or **Student Beans** to generate a single-use code for **50% off** full-priced pizzas.\n*   **NHS & Emergency Services (35% to 50% Off):** If you have a **Blue Light Card** or an NHS email address, you can access a dedicated single-use code for up to 50% off your order.\n*   **Two for Tuesday:** No code needed! Buy one pizza, get one free every Tuesday when you order through the \"Deals\" section of the app or website.\n\n---\n\n### **\ud83d\udca1 Pro-Tips for Getting the Best Price**\n1.  **Check the \"Deals\" Tab First:** Before paying full price, always look at the **Deals/Coupons** tab on the official Domino's app or website. Because most stores are locally owned, individual franchises often run \"local-only\" coupons that offer deeper discounts than national promo codes.\n2.  **The \"Deal Wizard\" (UK):** If you are ordering in the UK, add your items to the cart without any codes first. The Domino's \"Deal Wizard\" at checkout is designed to automatically bundle your cart into the best available deal to save you money. \n3.  **Use a Postcode Finder:** For UK users, websites like *Latest Deals* or *HotUKDeals* host active crowdsourced databases where you can input your postcode to find local store-specific codes (e.g., \"\u00a310 off over \u00a330\" or \"\u00a320 off over \u00a350\").",
